We are releasing Star Elastic, which turns one reasoning LLM into many sizes with a single post-training run. It is 360 times cheaper than pretraining a family of models and seven times better than state-of-the-art compression. It offers split reasoning capability and elastic budget control that surpasses the accuracy-latency frontier.

